## Acceptance routes
- accept_helios_idle: Watch a whole lamp-service and shuttle cycle without accepting a mission.
  Expected: A real source, journey, wait and service result are visible. The serviced object is the family lamp; the original dark twenty-fifth memorial plinth remains dark.
  Negative case: Do not count a looping orbit or lamp timer.
- accept_helios_return: Break one lamp, leave, save/Continue and return; then repair it.
  Expected: Damage persists, same service outcome changes only after real work.
  Negative case: Repeated load or repair event cannot duplicate parts or payouts.

